  "name": "Integrated Toolbox",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/magic/lightning/bolt-blue.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can integrate a weapon, item, or a set of tools into you with 10 minutes of uninterrupted work, which can be done as part of any rest. Once integrated, you can draw or stow the item as part of any action that involves its use, and you cannot be disarmed of it against your will. You can integrate a number of items equal to 1 + your proficiency bonus.</p>",
